{20}{Quite Frankly, yes. I used to supplement my income with a little adventuring, but I'm getting too old for that now. I wish I was still in my prime. I got a real juicy tip just recently.}{Quite Frankly, yes. I used to supplement my income with a little adventuring, but I'm getting too old for that now. I wish I was still in my prime. I got a real juicy tip just recently.}{}{}{}{}
{21}{Can you tell me about it?}{}{5}{}{30}{qu 1003 1, qu 1004 1, lf4 1}
