{25}{Virtually nothing that you already don't he was here, he spoke to a few folks, he left. I know he spoke to the Landers over on the west side of town, though... and strangely, I haven't seen them around much since. You might want to talk to Bara who lives next door to them.}{Virtually nothing that you already don't he was here, he spoke to a few folks, he left. I know he spoke to the Landers over on the west side of town, though... and strangely, I haven't seen them around much since. You might want to talk to Bara who lives next door to them.}{}{}{}{}
