{30}{Alright. It's like this. Wink Rathburn was an adventurer who chose to settle down here in Newberg before he died. Rumor has it that old Wink is buried somewhere near his lair on the Dark River- along with all his loot. Unfortunately, nobody seems to know where that lair is. However, my friend says old John Engstrom, the Innmistress's late husband, buried him.}{Yes. It's like this. Wink Rathburn was an adventurer who chose to settle down here in Newberg before he died. Rumor has it that old Wink is buried somewhere near his lair on the Dark River- along with all his loot. Unfortunately, nobody seems to know where that lair is. However, my friend says old Mr. Engstrom, the Innmistress's late husband, buried him.}{}{}{}{}
{31}{And you want me to find out where Wink's buried.}{}{10}{}{40}{}
{32}{...And?}{}{5}{}{45}{}
{33}{So? So what?}{}{-4}{}{45}{}
{34}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}
{40}{Precisely.}{Precisely.}{}{}{}{}
{41}{Ok. Where do I start?}{}{5}{}{45}{}
{45}{Well, I'm betting that there's something in old John Engstrom's belongings that might hold the clue we need. His widow, Phoebe Engstrom, may be able to help you, over at the Inn. However, convincing her to help you might be difficult.}{Well, I'm betting that there's something in old John Engstrom's belongings that might hold the clue we need. His widow, Phoebe Engstrom, may be able to help you, over at the Inn. However, convincing her to help you might be difficult.}{}{}{}{}
{46}{Why is that?}{}{5}{}{50}{qu 1003 2, qu 1004 2}
{47}{Why dat?}{}{-4}{}{50}{qu 1003 2, qu 1004 2}
{50}{She's a money-grubber. Any scent of a profit, and she'll be demanding a share of it. If you're not willing to pay her a cut, you'll need to find another way to get into her rooms. In any case, I only want one thing out of this deal. Wink had a mechanical Tophat I was very fond of. If you happen to see it, could you nab it for me? I can pay you 200 coin for it. Come talk to me when you've found the location of the River.}{She's a money-grubber. Any scent of a profit, and she'll be demanding a share of it. If you're not willing to pay her a cut, you'll need to find another way to get into her rooms. In any case, I only want one thing out of this deal. wink had a mechanical Tophat I was very fond of. If you happen to see it, could you nab it for me? I can pay you 200 coin for it. Come talk to me when you've found the location of the River.}{}{}{}{}
{51}{Hmmm... thanks for the advice.}{}{5}{}{0}{}
